      "Google Maps ranking — the three-listing \"local pack\" that shows up above the regular search results with a map, star rating, and call button — is where a huge share of ready-to-buy local searches get answered. \"Plumber near me,\" \"best salon in Tambaram,\" \"clinic open now\" — these all resolve to the map pack first. Most small businesses in Chennai never crack it, not because their business is worse than the competition, but because of a handful of fixable technical and profile gaps. Here's the checklist we actually use.",
