      "### 2. Get Your NAP Consistent Everywhere",
      "NAP — Name, Address, Phone number — needs to match exactly across your Google Business Profile, your website, and any other directory you're listed on (Justdial, Sulekha, industry directories). Even small inconsistencies (a missing suite number, \"Rd\" vs \"Road\") can quietly hurt how much Google trusts your location data. Do a search of your own business name and clean up any mismatches you find.",
