      "Almost every small business in Chennai already talks to customers on WhatsApp — the free Business app, one phone, one person checking messages. It works, until the volume grows past what one person can track. That's the point where \"WhatsApp Business API\" comes up, usually pitched by an agency as an upgrade. It's worth understanding what the WhatsApp Business API for Chennai businesses actually changes before paying for it, because for a lot of businesses the free app is genuinely still the right tool.",
      "### What the Free WhatsApp Business App Actually Gives You",
      "The free app (different from the API) gives one business account on one phone, basic labels and quick replies, a catalog, and automated greeting/away messages. For a solo owner or small team fielding a manageable volume of enquiries, this covers real needs at zero cost. Its limits show up around multi-person access (only one phone can be logged in at a time on the primary device), no proper integration with a CRM or website, and no reliable way to send bulk or automated messages without risking a ban.",
