      "Design gets most of the attention when a small business builds a website, and copywriting gets almost none — yet the actual words on the page are what convince a visitor to call, message, or buy. We review a lot of existing Chennai small business sites, and the same handful of website copywriting mistakes show up again and again, quietly costing conversions on sites that otherwise look fine.",
      "### Mistake 1: Leading With What You Do, Not What the Visitor Gets",
