      "Headlines like \"Quality You Can Trust\" or \"Your Satisfaction Is Our Priority\" could sit on literally any business's homepage and say nothing specific about this one. A stronger headline names the actual audience, the actual outcome, or the actual thing that makes this business different — specific enough that a competitor genuinely couldn't copy-paste it onto their own site.",
